= Edge AI Lab
The research group of Assoc. Prof. Phuong Luu Vo

The Edge AI Lab works on the algorithms behind networked intelligence: how computation is split
between a device and the edge, how learning survives when the data cannot be pooled, and how
the network underneath decides what is possible. It is the home of the
/Network Optimization and Distributed Learning/ group at the School of Computer Science and
Engineering, International University -- Vietnam National University Ho Chi Minh City.

== What we work on

- Semantic communication and edge intelligence
- Federated and distributed learning under limited communication
- Deep reinforcement learning for network control
- Resource allocation, caching and adaptive streaming
- Optimization and game theory for shared resources

See [interests.html Research Interests] for the longer version, and
[publications.html Publications] for the papers.

